// TEMPLATE vc5_vtable_pad_surface: emits neutral dummy virtual slots.
// Added because many hard matches needed exact virtual slot positions; use
// this inside a class before the real virtual whose vtable offset is known.
// Args: axis. Optional args: prefix. All names are neutral codegen dummies.
